  guideSlug: "how-to-mix-patterns-in-a-living-room",
  guideTitle: "How to Mix Patterns in a Living Room Without It Looking Chaotic",
  metaTitle: "How to Mix Patterns in a Living Room",
  metaDescription: "Mix patterns by varying scale, sharing one color, limiting the count to three and treating texture as pattern, with a clear order for where to start.",
